Subject: [PATCH v3 1/5] arm64: dts: meson: convert ugoos-am6 to common w400 dtsi
Date:   Mon, 18 May 2020 02:34:00 +0000
Message-Id: <20200518023404.15166-2-christianshewitt@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.17.1
In-Reply-To: <20200518023404.15166-1-christianshewitt@gmail.com>
